SUMMARY:DUE: 1st HK University Students FinTech Innovation Competition (ICBC 工行杯) - register
DESCRIPTION:Full-time HK university students\, teams of 1-3. Prizes HK$50\,000 / 30\,000 / 20\,000 / 10\,000 plus ICBC (Asia) internship opportunities\; HK final 27 Nov 2026\, national final Dec 2026. Register at gonghangbei.com.
