DTEND;TZID=Asia/Hong_Kong:20261006T213000
SUMMARY:IEEEXtreme 20.0 - register the team AND assign a proctor
DESCRIPTION:Two registrations are required. (1) The team: up to 3 IEEE Student members\, and a one-person team (solo entry) is allowed by the rules. (2) A proctor - MANDATORY\, and must be an IEEE member of a HIGHER grade than Student: a Student Branch Counselor\, a department chair or an IEEE Young Professional qualifies\, and one proctor may cover up to 20 teams. Teams select their Proctor of Record on the vTools registration platform. Candidate: Dr Tong (student-branch contact\, office A0339). Team registration itself closes 17 Oct 2026 23:59 GMT. Register at ieeextreme.org -> Register as participant / Register as proctor.
URL:https://ieeextreme.org/
CATEGORIES:Competition
END:VEVENT
