SUMMARY:DUE: IEEEXtreme 20.0 code-library upload closes (23:59 UTC 29 Oct)
DESCRIPTION:Teams may upload their own code libraries (up to 100 KB) to the CSAcademy workspace template before the competition. For IEEEXtreme 20.0 that upload closes at 23:59 UTC on 29 October 2026 = 07:59 HKT on 30 October. Worth doing if you want your usual templates and utility functions available during the 24 hours.
URL:https://ieeextreme.org/rules/
CATEGORIES:Competition
END:VEVENT
